{
  "provenance": "Forty independent synthetic SmartArt controls regenerated and saved by the native reference application. A TX node sets primary font size and height equal to its secondary font, with absent, explicit, or referenced secondary size and optional literal left margin. Insets and height are saved EMUs. Fractional cases separate initial font calculations from later simultaneous whole-point font trials: default secondary size uses the unrounded initial primary, whereas final margin and dimension references see rounded fonts. Tests exercise initial defaults and caller-applied numeric trials; they do not claim a completed text layout or font-rounding implementation.",
